# What git is to leave alone under mac/: what Xcode and the Swift package manager make
# for themselves, and what is one person's own arrangement of Xcode.
#
# Kept: the Xcode project, its shared scheme, and every Package.resolved (they say
# which version of a dependency the app was built and tested with).

# Build results
.build/
DerivedData/
/build/

# One person's own Xcode state
xcuserdata/
*.xcuserstate

# The package manager's working folder, and the Xcode workspace it makes for a package
.swiftpm/

# What a test build writes where it is run from
*.profraw
